[
  {"id":"PROP_VISCOMETER_02","chapter":"properties","solver":"coaxialViscometer","title":"Exercice 1.4 — Viscosimètre à cylindres coaxiaux","difficulty":3,"statement":"Un viscosimètre est constitué de deux cylindres coaxiaux. Le cylindre intérieur, de rayon Rᵢ et de hauteur L, tourne à N tr/min à l’intérieur du cylindre extérieur fixe de rayon Rₑ. L’espace annulaire est rempli d’huile. Le couple mesuré sur l’arbre est C. En négligeant les effets de fond et en assimilant l’écoulement dans le mince entrefer à un Couette plan, déterminer la viscosité dynamique de l’huile.","variables":[{"key":"ri","label":"Rayon intérieur Rᵢ","unit":"mm","value":60,"min":30,"max":80,"step":5},{"key":"ro","label":"Rayon extérieur Rₑ","unit":"mm","value":62,"min":32,"max":84,"step":1},{"key":"L","label":"Hauteur L","unit":"mm","value":200,"min":100,"max":350,"step":25},{"key":"rpm","label":"Rotation N","unit":"tr/min","value":90,"min":60,"max":300,"step":10},{"key":"torque","label":"Couple C","unit":"N·m","value":0.9,"min":0.1,"max":1.5,"step":0.05}],"questions":[{"key":"omega","label":"Vitesse angulaire ω","unit":"rad/s"},{"key":"U","label":"Vitesse périphérique U","unit":"m/s"},{"key":"gap","label":"Entrefer e","unit":"m"},{"key":"mu","label":"Viscosité μ","unit":"Pa·s"},{"key":"tau","label":"Contrainte τ","unit":"Pa"}]},
  {"id":"PROP_CAPILLARY_03","chapter":"properties","solver":"capillary","title":"Exercice 1.5 — Ascension capillaire","difficulty":2,"statement":"Calculer la hauteur d’ascension capillaire de l’eau à 20 °C dans un tube de verre propre de diamètre d (θ = 0). Quel diamètre minimal faut-il donner à un tube piézométrique pour que l’erreur capillaire reste inférieure à h_max ? Varier d pour retrouver les deux cas du polycopié (0,5 mm et 5 mm).","variables":[{"key":"d","label":"Diamètre du tube d","unit":"mm","value":0.5,"min":0.1,"max":10,"step":0.1},{"key":"sigma","label":"Tension superficielle σ","unit":"N/m","value":0.073,"min":0.065,"max":0.075,"step":0.001},{"key":"theta","label":"Angle de contact θ","unit":"°","value":0,"min":0,"max":45,"step":5},{"key":"rho","label":"Masse volumique ρ","unit":"kg/m³","value":1000,"min":990,"max":1010,"step":5},{"key":"hMax","label":"Erreur capillaire max. h_max","unit":"mm","value":3,"min":1,"max":10,"step":0.5}],"questions":[{"key":"h","label":"Hauteur capillaire h","unit":"m"},{"key":"dMin","label":"Diamètre minimal D","unit":"mm"}]},
  {"id":"PROP_LAPLACE_04","chapter":"properties","solver":"laplace","title":"Exercice 1.6 — Surpression dans une gouttelette","difficulty":2,"statement":"Une gouttelette d’eau issue d’un asperseur a un diamètre de 0,20 mm, soit un rayon R. Calculer la surpression à l’intérieur de la gouttelette (une seule interface).","variables":[{"key":"radius","label":"Rayon R = d/2","unit":"µm","value":100,"min":20,"max":500,"step":20},{"key":"sigma","label":"Tension superficielle σ","unit":"N/m","value":0.073,"min":0.065,"max":0.075,"step":0.001},{"key":"factor","label":"Nombre d’interfaces ×2","unit":"—","value":2,"min":2,"max":4,"step":2}],"questions":[{"key":"dp","label":"Surpression Δp","unit":"Pa"}]},
  {"id":"PROP_GAS_05","chapter":"properties","solver":"idealGas","title":"Exercice 1.7 — Gaz parfait","difficulty":1,"statement":"Une bouteille d’air comprimé de volume 𝒱 est à la pression absolue p et à la température T. Calculer la masse d’air contenue, puis le volume qu’occuperait cet air à la pression atmosphérique et à la même température.","variables":[{"key":"volumeL","label":"Volume 𝒱","unit":"L","value":50,"min":20,"max":80,"step":5},{"key":"pressure","label":"Pression absolue p","unit":"bar","value":200,"min":50,"max":300,"step":10},{"key":"temp","label":"Température T","unit":"°C","value":25,"min":0,"max":40,"step":5},{"key":"R","label":"Constante de l’air r","unit":"J/(kg·K)","value":287,"min":287,"max":287,"step":1},{"key":"pAtm","label":"Pression atmosphérique","unit":"bar","value":1.013,"min":1,"max":1.05,"step":0.001}],"questions":[{"key":"rho","label":"Masse volumique ρ","unit":"kg/m³"},{"key":"mass","label":"Masse d’air m","unit":"kg"},{"key":"V2","label":"Volume à pₐₜₘ 𝒱₂","unit":"m³"}]},
  {"id":"HYDRO_INCLINED_06","chapter":"hydrostatics","solver":"inclinedCircularGate","title":"Exercice 2.6 — Vanne circulaire inclinée","difficulty":3,"statement":"Une vanne circulaire de diamètre D est située dans une paroi inclinée de α sur l’horizontale. Son centre est à h_G sous la surface libre. Calculer la poussée et la distance, mesurée le long de la paroi, entre le centre de la vanne et le centre de poussée.","variables":[{"key":"D","label":"Diamètre D","unit":"m","value":1.2,"min":0.6,"max":2,"step":0.1},{"key":"alpha","label":"Inclinaison α","unit":"°","value":60,"min":30,"max":90,"step":5},{"key":"hG","label":"Profondeur du centre h_G","unit":"m","value":2.4,"min":1,"max":5,"step":0.1},{"key":"rho","label":"Masse volumique ρ","unit":"kg/m³","value":1000,"min":990,"max":1010,"step":5}],"questions":[{"key":"force","label":"Poussée F","unit":"N"},{"key":"yG","label":"Abscisse y_G sur la paroi","unit":"m"},{"key":"dy","label":"Écart y_C − y_G","unit":"m"}]},
  {"id":"HYDRO_CURVED_07","chapter":"hydrostatics","solver":"quarterCylinder","title":"Exercice 2.7 — Paroi courbe : vanne quart de cylindre","difficulty":3,"statement":"Une vanne en quart de cylindre de rayon R et de largeur b retient de l’eau. La surface libre affleure la génératrice supérieure ; l’eau est du côté concave, au-dessus de la vanne. Calculer les composantes horizontale et verticale de la poussée, la résultante et son inclinaison.","variables":[{"key":"R","label":"Rayon R","unit":"m","value":2,"min":1,"max":4,"step":0.25},{"key":"b","label":"Largeur b","unit":"m","value":3,"min":1,"max":6,"step":0.5},{"key":"rho","label":"Masse volumique ρ","unit":"kg/m³","value":1000,"min":990,"max":1010,"step":5}],"questions":[{"key":"FH","label":"Composante horizontale F_H","unit":"N"},{"key":"FV","label":"Composante verticale F_V","unit":"N"},{"key":"F","label":"Résultante F","unit":"N"},{"key":"beta","label":"Inclinaison β sous l’horizontale","unit":"°"}]},
  {"id":"HYDRO_ARCHIMEDE_08","chapter":"hydrostatics","solver":"archimedesCaisson","title":"Exercice 2.8 — Poussée d’Archimède : densimètre et caisson","difficulty":2,"statement":"1. Un bloc de béton de volume 𝒱 et de masse volumique ρ_béton est entièrement immergé dans l’eau, suspendu à un câble. Calculer la tension du câble. 2. Un caisson L × B × H pèse W. Vérifier qu’il flotte en eau de mer et calculer son tirant d’eau.","variables":[{"key":"volBlock","label":"Volume du bloc 𝒱","unit":"m³","value":0.8,"min":0.4,"max":2,"step":0.1},{"key":"rhoB","label":"Masse volumique béton","unit":"kg/m³","value":2400,"min":2200,"max":2500,"step":50},{"key":"L","label":"Longueur du caisson L","unit":"m","value":6,"min":4,"max":12,"step":0.5},{"key":"B","label":"Largeur du caisson B","unit":"m","value":4,"min":2,"max":8,"step":0.5},{"key":"Hbox","label":"Hauteur du caisson H","unit":"m","value":3,"min":2,"max":5,"step":0.25},{"key":"W","label":"Poids du caisson W","unit":"kN","value":500,"min":200,"max":800,"step":25},{"key":"rho","label":"Masse volumique mer","unit":"kg/m³","value":1025,"min":1000,"max":1030,"step":5}],"questions":[{"key":"T","label":"Tension du câble T","unit":"N"},{"key":"FAmax","label":"Poussée max. du caisson","unit":"N"},{"key":"Te","label":"Tirant d’eau Tₑ","unit":"m"},{"key":"freeboard","label":"Franc-bord","unit":"m"}]},
  {"id":"HYDRO_PRESS_03","chapter":"hydrostatics","solver":"hydraulicPress","title":"Exercice 2.3 — Presse hydraulique","difficulty":1,"statement":"Une presse hydraulique comporte un petit piston de diamètre d et un grand piston de diamètre D situé au même niveau. Quelle force faut-il exercer sur le petit piston pour soulever la charge F posée sur le grand piston ? Quel est le déplacement du petit piston pour une montée E de la charge ?","variables":[{"key":"dSmall","label":"Petit diamètre d","unit":"mm","value":40,"min":20,"max":80,"step":5},{"key":"dBig","label":"Grand diamètre D","unit":"mm","value":320,"min":160,"max":400,"step":20},{"key":"load","label":"Charge F","unit":"N","value":60000,"min":20000,"max":100000,"step":5000},{"key":"bigTravel","label":"Montée E du grand piston","unit":"mm","value":10,"min":5,"max":30,"step":5}],"questions":[{"key":"ratio","label":"Rapport A₂/A₁","unit":"—"},{"key":"smallForce","label":"Effort F₁","unit":"N"},{"key":"smallTravel","label":"Course x₁","unit":"mm"}]},
  {"id":"FORCE_CIRCULAR_03","chapter":"hydrostatics","solver":"circularGate","title":"Vanne circulaire verticale","difficulty":2,"statement":"Une vanne circulaire verticale est entièrement immergée. Déterminer la poussée et la profondeur du centre de poussée.","variables":[{"key":"D","label":"Diamètre D","unit":"m","value":0.9,"min":0.5,"max":2,"step":0.1},{"key":"yc","label":"Profondeur du centre ȳ","unit":"m","value":3.2,"min":1.5,"max":6,"step":0.2},{"key":"rho","label":"Masse volumique ρ","unit":"kg/m³","value":1000,"min":990,"max":1010,"step":5}],"questions":[{"key":"area","label":"Aire A","unit":"m²"},{"key":"force","label":"Poussée F","unit":"N"},{"key":"yp","label":"Centre de poussée yₚ","unit":"m"}]},
  {"id":"HYDRO_STABILITY_04","chapter":"hydrostatics","solver":"bargeStability","title":"Exercice 2.9 — Stabilité d’un caisson flottant","difficulty":3,"statement":"Pour le caisson de l’exercice 2.8 (tirant d’eau Tₑ), le centre de gravité est à z_G au-dessus du fond. Étudier la stabilité au roulis (inclinaison autour de l’axe longitudinal, largeur B au cube).","variables":[{"key":"L","label":"Longueur L","unit":"m","value":6,"min":4,"max":14,"step":0.5},{"key":"B","label":"Largeur B","unit":"m","value":4,"min":2,"max":8,"step":0.5},{"key":"draft","label":"Tirant d’eau Tₑ","unit":"m","value":2.07,"min":0.8,"max":2.8,"step":0.01},{"key":"zG","label":"Hauteur du centre G","unit":"m","value":1.4,"min":0.8,"max":2.5,"step":0.05},{"key":"rho","label":"Masse volumique mer","unit":"kg/m³","value":1025,"min":1000,"max":1030,"step":5}],"questions":[{"key":"volume","label":"Volume déplacé ∇","unit":"m³"},{"key":"mass","label":"Masse déplacée","unit":"kg"},{"key":"zB","label":"Hauteur du centre B","unit":"m"},{"key":"BM","label":"Rayon métacentrique BM","unit":"m"},{"key":"GM","label":"Hauteur métacentrique GM","unit":"m"}]}
